Description

 Established the initial foundation for the Pharma Store website by configuring the base module, project structure, website routing, reusable templates, and frontend assets. This commit prepares the application for future development of pharmacy-specific features, including product management, prescription uploads, subscription services, AI healthcare assistance, and responsive storefront components.

Business Requirement

 The objective of this implementation was to create a scalable and maintainable foundation for an online pharmacy platform capable of supporting healthcare products, medicine subscriptions, prescription management, and digital healthcare services.

A modular architecture was required to simplify future feature development while maintaining code organization and reusability.

