 *Configured QWeb template structure.
 *Added reusable frontend layout components.
 *Organized static assets (CSS, JavaScript, Images).
 *Prepared responsive Bootstrap-based layout.
 *Configured asset bundles for frontend resources.
 *Established reusable section templates.
 *Prepared project structure for future module integration.

